[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アターック！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Attack!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きゃあっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんて球の速さ……！\n二人ともさすがね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a fast ball...! You two are really something!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっへん！\u3000いつも練習してますから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe! We practice all the time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても、急にビーチバレーの練習をする\nだなんて、どうしたんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still, why did you suddenly decide we should practice beach volleyball?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはぁ……\nお二人が、今日からヴィーナスの仲間だからです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's because... you're both part of the Venus family now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお！\u3000やりぃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh! Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ビーチバレーはヴィーナスフェスの基本だから、\nみんな、できるようになった方がいいかなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Beach volleyball is a Venus Festival staple, so I thought it'd be good if everyone could play."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マリーちゃんやオーナーさんと話して、\n二人を練習に誘うことにしたんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I talked it over with Marie and the Owner, and we decided to invite you two to practice."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほどなー。\nそれに、こんな水着まで用意してくれるなんて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. And you even got us these swimsuits too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どう？\u3000似合ってる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So? Do I look good?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろんです、姉様！\n世界で一番かわいいわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, Alvina! You're the cutest in the world!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにをー！\u3000世界一はレスナちゃんだもん！\nレスナちゃーん！\u3000いい感じだよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey now! Resna's the cutest in the world! You look great, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう……ちょっと恥ずかしいかも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... this is a little embarrassing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、ヴィーナスフェスに参加する二人は、\n色んなアクティビティに参加することになるから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since you're both entering the Venus Festival, you'll be participating in all sorts of activities..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "オーナーさんにお願いして、いつでも練習できる\nようにしてもらいました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I asked the Owner to let you practice whenever you want!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たくさん練習して、優勝目指して頑張りましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's practice hard and aim for first place!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっしゃ！\u3000それじゃあここからアタシたちは、\n友達でありフェスの好敵手でもあるってことね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right! So from here on out, we're friends but also rivals in the festival!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな、優勝目指して頑張ろー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone, let's do our best to win!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "一同",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "帰る方法を探すのも忘れないようにね……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just don't forget to keep looking for a way home too..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]